{"2246040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Phoenix Gene VR", "steam_appid": 2246040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4076930, 4084840], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewrite the Past. Save the Future.</strong> Step into an adrenaline-fueled VR shooter where survival means becoming immortal. Control a blazing phoenix in your hands, and fight alongside Jackie, a genetically enhanced janitor bound to Firestorm by fate. Together, you’ll battle through the collapsing Slipstream multiverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Sci-fi Saga Across Time: </strong>Fly from scorched wastelands to dazzling future cities in a race against extinction. Every location is a battlefield - and a piece of the narrative puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/a48cf42dfcd6b95c9dd0e4b5f0fabf16.poster.avif?t=1780496080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/a48cf42dfcd6b95c9dd0e4b5f0fabf16.webm?t=1780496080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/a48cf42dfcd6b95c9dd0e4b5f0fabf16.mp4?t=1780496080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies Everywhere: </strong> Mutants, Scavengers, Leviathans and Drones... relentless foes lurk around every corner. Blast your way through heart-pounding VR combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/f09e69242fd0a941056a3a8eabd59303.poster.avif?t=1780496080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/f09e69242fd0a941056a3a8eabd59303.webm?t=1780496080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/f09e69242fd0a941056a3a8eabd59303.mp4?t=1780496080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect the Innocent: </strong>Defend, catch, deliver and save innocents from dangers in... and outside of our reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/b64ff6bed7b6ecd4c56d7cab49af3cea.poster.avif?t=1780496080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/b64ff6bed7b6ecd4c56d7cab49af3cea.webm?t=1780496080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/b64ff6bed7b6ecd4c56d7cab49af3cea.mp4?t=1780496080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Immersion, Total Action: </strong>Fly, dodge, and shoot in this physical, action-packed VR shooter ‘shmup that’ll give you an addictive rush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/a86c06429dfc87fb3cac3af4b2052656.poster.avif?t=1780496080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/a86c06429dfc87fb3cac3af4b2052656.webm?t=1780496080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/a86c06429dfc87fb3cac3af4b2052656.mp4?t=1780496080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Shooting:</strong> Toggle between realms to absorb enemy bullets, bend reality to your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/668b2d3c8e9580d07aa57d3abccb3407.poster.avif?t=1780496080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/668b2d3c8e9580d07aa57d3abccb3407.webm?t=1780496080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/668b2d3c8e9580d07aa57d3abccb3407.mp4?t=1780496080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Up or Perish:</strong> Collect gold flames to unlock game-changing upgrades: smart bombs, quad fireballs, shields, extended reach, faster regeneration, and flamethrower boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/77dd2451f0fbd7064dd5b54491ff5bd5.poster.avif?t=1780496080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/77dd2451f0fbd7064dd5b54491ff5bd5.webm?t=1780496080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/77dd2451f0fbd7064dd5b54491ff5bd5.mp4?t=1780496080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Deeper:</strong> Immerse yourself in the VR Book Experience of 'The Phoenix Gene: Origins of Darkness' included with the game. Read and listen to the first chapter of the novel in the epic new dystopian sci-fi story, all inside your headset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the Fight: </strong>Move to the upbeat soundtrack by legendary composer <strong>Grant Kirkhope</strong>. Amplify the immersion with <strong>bHaptics TactSuit</strong>, <strong>TactSleeve</strong> and <strong>TactVisor</strong> to feel every explosion and hit in your bones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Slipstream Master: </strong>Buy The Phoenix Gene now, strap in, and take flight. Perfect for fans of Pistol Whip, Star Fox, Panzer Dragoon, and R-type.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/10ee7c11406ba2b65ea45855da1eb1e1.avif?t=1780496080\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras_big/10ee7c11406ba2b65ea45855da1eb1e1.avif?t=1780496080 width=1560 height=918 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Supports Meta Air/Link and Virtual Desktop (set to VDXR or Automatic) and Steam VR (Open XR). Note that controller offsets will be different per setup, and should be customized in the options for best results.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewrite the Past. Save the Future.</strong> Step into an adrenaline-fueled VR shooter where survival means becoming immortal. Control a blazing phoenix in your hands, and fight alongside Jackie, a genetically enhanced janitor bound to Firestorm by fate. Together, you’ll battle through the collapsing Slipstream multiverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Sci-fi Saga Across Time: </strong>Fly from scorched wastelands to dazzling future cities in a race against extinction. Every location is a battlefield - and a piece of the narrative puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246040/extras/a48cf42dfcd6b95c9dd0e4b5f0fabf16.poster.avif?t=1780496080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati